{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">TVB熱播劇《夫妻的博弈》踏入結局周！劇中李海銅與高海寧、楊卓娜、何沛珈及游嘉欣組成「QMC女子組」，大展姊妹情同強勁的Girl Power，深受網民歡迎。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">私下幾位靚女亦十分好友，李海銅日前在社交平台分享與游嘉欣等人撐枱腳的合照，並感恩記錄道：「8月小碎片！幸運的是沿途遇到的都是很溫暖的人這個暑假很充實 有 #夫妻的博弈 #怪宿宿2想天開同大家見面」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4f9ccd66-44ae-46e7-9555-66d1aa1a5700.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ENpDmKVzbZ1788317509.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4f9ccd66-44ae-46e7-9555-66d1aa1a5700.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"39a23241-6280-424e-a753-ac522313c95c.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Jg4osY23lz1788317509.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"39a23241-6280-424e-a753-ac522313c95c.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中除了見到她與《夫妻的博弈》好姊妹聚會，更有與綜藝《怪宿宿2想天開》一班好友蔡景行、馮皓揚以及李茵彤的溫馨合照，可謂劇集、綜藝雙線發展！而在即將播映的新劇《死有對証》中，李海銅亦有份參與演出，不少粉絲紛紛留言加油支持：「繼續加油！繼續見到你演出」、「Nice girl」，期待她在新劇中的全新表現！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6aa22661-91fb-4915-9c88-041509f8c2e2.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026F6h0fHrEG11788317509.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6aa22661-91fb-4915-9c88-041509f8c2e2.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f59418db-1fbd-4a33-9306-e8431da9cb10.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20264SLLZw51Dj1788317508.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f59418db-1fbd-4a33-9306-e8431da9cb10.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T03:23:59.097288+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}